			"Message": "fix(Project): Resolve URI object construction inconsistencies across editor services\n\nSubmodule synchronization completing the URI handling fix across multiple layers:\n\n1. Mountain (2120ad5e): Use DebugOnce instead of dev_log! for unregistered view-action and workbench-internal commands to reduce log noise from repeated invocations\n2. Output (3db8e24c): Add missing URI class import to ExposeWorkbenchAccessor transform, enabling SkyBridge to construct resource objects the workbench accepts directly\n3. Sky (18f9fb7f): Add BuildOpenArg helper that produces real URI instances when URI service is available, falling back to POJO only for code paths that call revive\n\nThis completes the fix from the previous commit for search results deduplication by ensuring open commands (vscode.open, OpenFile) also use proper URI construction rather than manual `{ $mid: 1, path, scheme }` objects that fail when consumers call uri.with() or uri.toString() directly.\n\nImpact: Consistent URI handling across search results and file open commands, eliminating \"uri.with is not a function\" errors and improving workbench result deduplication.",
			"SHA": "f5bf511b04b9b847de673bae8f23e70d9e6317b4"
